# Battle Buddy — Cursor rules

You are in https://github.com/wyldephyre/battle-buddy

This is Hackyard Yard #1. Theme: no accounts. Solo. Captain Phyre only.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/PRD.md` before you write files.

## Do

- Write new modules under `battlebuddy/` and the Hermes skill under `skills/battle-buddy/`
- Keep voice-first, local memory, typed fallback
- One change set per turn when possible
- After a meaningful change, name the files touched and the single next step

## Do not

- Copy code from `wyldephyre/veteran-gaming-assistant`
- Add login, email capture, OAuth, Steam API keys, or cloud STT as the default
- Require SuperGrok or any provider account to complete the reminder loop
- Put Jessica / MPOW doctrine in the UI
- Expand scope past: speak/type reminder → confirm → fire → persist

## Acceptance for the first loop

A user with no account can set a 1-minute reminder, hear or see it fire, restart, and still see it.
